flowchart TB

  v_caller["The caller shall populate <br/>roles with the list of <br/>stream roles needed for the <br/>use cases for which it <br/>wants a default <br/>configuration. The caller <br/>can examine the returned <br/>configuration to learn <br/>about the selected streams <br/>and their default <br/>parameters."]
  v_generate["PipelineHandler::<br/>generateConfiguration may <br/>be called from any thread <br/>and shall be thread-safe. <br/>It shall not modify the <br/>state of camera in the <br/>pipeline handler. It <br/>returns a valid <br/>CameraConfiguration if the <br/>requested roles can be <br/>satisfied, or a null <br/>pointer otherwise."]
  v_camera["Camera receives the <br/>configuration to apply from <br/>the application and is the <br/>intended caller of <br/>PipelineHandler::configure."]
  v_validation["config is guaranteed to <br/>have been validated with <br/>CameraConfiguration::<br/>validate. The pipeline <br/>handler implementation <br/>shall not perform further <br/>validation and may rely on <br/>any custom field stored in <br/>its custom <br/>CameraConfiguration derived <br/>class."]
  v_configure["PipelineHandler::configure <br/>is called from the <br/>CameraManager thread and <br/>configures the group of <br/>streams for camera <br/>according to config. It <br/>returns 0 on success or a <br/>negative error code <br/>otherwise."]
  v_setstream["When configuring the <br/>camera, the pipeline <br/>handler shall use <br/>StreamConfiguration::<br/>setStream to associate a <br/>Stream instance with each <br/>StreamConfiguration entry <br/>in the CameraConfiguration."]
